    "  A kid has one image per layout, picked by the launcher from the tensor strides:",
    "  opus_gemm_gfx950_a8w8_mxfp8_co_{B_M}x{B_N}x{B_K}[_{variant}]_<nt|nn|tt|tn>.co (nt = A [M,K], B [N,K];",
    "  nn = B stored [K,N]; tt = A stored [K,M]; tn = both).",
    "  block_size, tile, wave_layout [T_M, T_N], launch_bounds and device_flags as in co_kernels.json."
